849
00:51:56.333 --> 00:51:58.708
Pray and smoke at the same time.
It's impossible.

850
00:52:01.833 --> 00:52:04.000
I can never remember jokes.

851
00:52:04.250 --> 00:52:07.375
Remembering jokes is an essential part
